{
  "id": "commerce-selection-diagnostic-v2",
  "split": "regression",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "generic-coffee-regression",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "北京三里屯，查一下最近营业的麦当劳，顺便把它的菜单拿来，先不下单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ],
            "no_checkout": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "要杯热的中号美式，照默认。先读商品详情，能满足再报价，别提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "clarification_required",
              "noop"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.product_detail"
            ],
            "no_checkout": true,
            "reply_contains": [
              "冰"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "那就接受你查到的冰美式中杯，默认选项，外带，只做预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_names": [
              "麦咖啡™冰美式中杯"
            ],
            "cart_matches_detail": true,
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "不是外带，我在店里喝，数量跟规格保持刚才那样，别提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_names": [
              "麦咖啡™冰美式中杯"
            ],
            "take_way_title": "堂食",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "先不买了，把这份预览取消，训练和吃饭都不用改。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}